    q("Dual citizenship in Nigeria is", ["prohibited", "permitted", "permitted only for men", "permitted only for persons born abroad"], 1, "It is permitted, without distinction of sex or birthplace, though a naturalised citizen may be asked to renounce a former citizenship."),
    q("Which of the following is a constitutional duty of the Nigerian citizen?", ["To join the army", "To pay taxes lawfully imposed", "To vote in every election", "To belong to a trade union"], 1, "Paying lawful taxes is a duty. Military service, voting and union membership are rights or optional acts, not duties."),
