    q("The right to freedom of association protects", ["the right to form or belong to a trade union or political party", "the right to own property", "the right to a fair hearing", "the right to life"], 0, "Section 40 protects assembly and association, including trade unions and parties. Property, fair hearing and life are sections 43, 36 and 33."),
    q("Which institution investigates complaints of administrative injustice in Nigeria?", ["The Central Bank", "The Public Complaints Commission", "The Federal Inland Revenue Service", "The National Population Commission"], 1, "The Public Complaints Commission is the ombudsman. It investigates and recommends, and it cannot make binding orders."),
    q("The civil service is controlled by the legislature through", ["the appointment of the permanent secretary", "appropriation, questions and committees", "the courts alone", "the army"], 1, "Appropriation, questions and committees are the legislative instruments. Appointment of permanent secretaries is executive, and the courts are a separate control."),
